1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:06,620
Once upon a time, animals lived in peace
in a forest.

2
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:11,380
Their leader and king was Aya Anbesa.

3
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:16,180
One day, the donkey and the leopard
began chatting.

4
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:22,980
Looking at the grass, the donkey said,
'This grass is blue.'

5
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:29,580
The leopard replied, 'No, it is green!
Are your eyes broken?'

6
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:35,540
'Let us go to our king, Aya Anbesa,'
they said, and went.

7
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:42,980
Donkey said, 'O King, he disputes that
this grass is blue.'

8
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:49,380
Aya Anbesa calmly ruled, 'Yes, the grass
is blue.'

9
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:57,100
Saddened, the leopard asked, 'O King,
why did you rule it is blue?'

10
00:00:57,800 --> 00:01:06,196
The king: 'I know very well the grass is
green. Your punishment is not about the

11
00:01:06,196 --> 00:01:06,940
grass.'

12
00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:13,300
'Because you chose to waste your time
arguing with a foolish donkey!'

13
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:19,100
The leopard understood his king's
wisdom, asked forgiveness, and left.
